+### Quick Search Example
+
+```bash
+# Search for markets about a topic
+curl -s "https://gamma-api.polymarket.com/markets?search=bitcoin&limit=5" | \
+  python3 -c "
+import json, sys
+markets = json.load(sys.stdin)
+for m in markets:
+    prices = json.loads(m.get('outcomePrices', '[\"?\",\"?\"]'))
+    yes_pct = float(prices[0]) * 100 if prices[0] != '?' else '?'
+    print(f\"{m['question']}\")
+    print(f\"  Yes: {yes_pct:.1f}%  Volume: \${float(m.get('volume','0')):,.0f}\")
+    print()
+"
+```
